--- !u!114 &833757283
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 833757276}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ea768deea00c4ad4ea64024f2e793b0f, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueInteractable
  npcName: Forensic Officer
  npcPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 85622a530d3f9e044bece05b21119254, type: 3}
  playerName: ' Detective Frankcesca'
  playerPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 85622a530d3f9e044bece05b21119254, type: 3}
  lines:
  - speaker: 1
    text: ' You''re the Bureau investigator?

'
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: 0
    text: " Yes, that's me. What have you found?\r\n "
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: 1
    text: " Alright, then. Frank Clifford been dead approximately fifteen to sixteen
      hours, so the death happened between around seven to eight PM. \r\n\r\n"
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: 1
    text: No sign of forced entry. No defensive injuries. No evidence of a struggle.
      His implant is the cause of death
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: 0
    text: 'He accessed it himself?

'
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: 1
    text: ' Looks like it. The maintenance interface was manually opened. Neural
      safeguards were disabled from the local interface, then the implant was overloaded.
      It was a neural shutdown that killed him.

'
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: 0
    text: Any indication someone else was involved?
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: 1
    text: ' Nothing we''ve found. His apartment security logs are clean. No unauthorised
      entries. '
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: 1
    text: ' No unusual network activity around the time of death. Everything points
      in the same direction.



'
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: 0
    text: ' Suicide.

'
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: 1
    text: 'That''s our assessment. You can take another look if you want, but I wouldn''t
      expect surprises. '
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
